The '''Umbaran shadow cloak''',<ref name="SWCE" /> also known as the '''Umbaran garb''',<ref name="HC22">{{HelmetCollectionCite|22|Weapons & Uniforms}}</ref> was a traditional garment of the [[Umbaran]]s, or "Shadow People." A voluminous [[cloak]] made up of numerous strands<ref name="SWCE" /> that made it look as if it had been spun from feathers,<ref name="Catalyst">''[[Catalyst: A Rogue One Novel]]''</ref> it appeared [[Color|white]] but was in fact patterned in ultraviolet colors, which the Umbarans could see. [[Sly Moore]], an Umbaran [[Gender|female]] who served as an [[aide]] to [[Supreme Chancellor]] [[Darth Sidious|Palpatine]] of the [[Galactic Republic]] during the [[Clone Wars]], wore a shadow cloak.<ref name="SWCE" />

